{"page":169,"width":1854,"height":2819,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"5.1 기본 개념 223","words":[{"text":"5.1","x":1328,"y":176,"width":49,"height":25},{"text":"기본","x":1399,"y":177,"width":45,"height":27},{"text":"개념","x":1456,"y":177,"width":45,"height":27},{"text":"223","x":1579,"y":170,"width":61,"height":31}]},{"text":"는 비선점 방식으로 실기|될 수 있다. 비선집형 거덜은 문다니 교환을 하기 전에 시스템 골","words":[{"text":"는","x":292,"y":318,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"비선점","x":341,"y":315,"width":94,"height":40},{"text":"방식으로","x":454,"y":316,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"실기|될","x":603,"y":316,"width":93,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":713,"y":317,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":763,"y":317,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"비선집형","x":855,"y":317,"width":130,"height":40},{"text":"거덜은","x":1007,"y":316,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"문다니","x":1123,"y":315,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"교환을","x":1207,"y":316,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"하기","x":1326,"y":316,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"전에","x":1411,"y":315,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"시스템","x":1493,"y":315,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"골","x":1609,"y":318,"width":34,"height":36}]},{"text":"이 완료되기나 입출력 완료를 기다리며 프로세스가 봉쇄되기를 기다린다. 거닐 자료구","words":[{"text":"이","x":294,"y":380,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"완료되기나","x":342,"y":381,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"입출력","x":526,"y":381,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"완료를","x":640,"y":381,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"기다리며","x":760,"y":382,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"프로세스가","x":910,"y":382,"width":172,"height":40},{"text":"봉쇄되기를","x":1099,"y":382,"width":174,"height":39},{"text":"기다린다.","x":1292,"y":382,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"거닐","x":1458,"y":381,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"자료구","x":1542,"y":381,"width":101,"height":39}]},{"text":"조가 비일관적인 상대에 있을 때 거덜이 해당 프로세스를 선점하지 않기 때문에, 이러한","words":[{"text":"조가","x":294,"y":445,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"비일관적인","x":376,"y":445,"width":162,"height":39},{"text":"상대에","x":553,"y":445,"width":96,"height"